# WHAT IT COVERS: the 2026-11-04 stream, 70.7 minutes cut to the stretch its video shows, captured
# through Windows.Graphics.Capture with o:vsync on the build that added the flow warp's cut gate
# (2044bc4), its first stream. The game hitched (20 to 100 ms) 469 times (398 an hour) and stalled
# for 100 ms or more 74 times (63 an hour), in 99 bursts, 50 of them with a stall, with no periodic
# stretch; 36 of the stall bursts sit within 3 s of a cut to or from black that the cut gate
# logged (map opens, the wait and sleep dial), and the last minutes hold a run of the dial with
# 23 hitches in 35 s at about 4055 s. The lock released 10 times; the worst blend run,
# 39 presents, sits at 816.7 s and ends in one of them. Of the 45 moves on the replay, 10 of them
# late, 8 land more than 2 ms from a real frame.
# WINDOW. The video pairs with this log at log time = video time + 50.117 s, from the 2431
# marked frames in its first 40 s, all on time within 0.43 ms of that offset (p90). The video
# runs 4239.7 s with no holes. It opens on gameplay (marked), shows the inventory at about 55 s,
# and ends on the wait and sleep dial and then gameplay; the cut is the whole video, 50.1 s to
# 4289.8 s. Inside the cut, 24 seconds in 24 runs fall out of the 60 fps regime, each a single
# hitch second.
# FIDELITY. The capture ran the policy the tree ships, so the two lines are comparable. The
# replay line reads synth 0.8% against 0.8%, worst run 39 against 39, runs >= 50 0 against 0 and
# pull wraps 72 against 72. On the dejitter arm, which is how the stream ran, blends are 2023
# against 2033, repeats 526 against 519, skips 207 against 207, pull wraps 61.2 an hour against
# 61.1 and the worst run 39 against 39. The replay makes 45 moves, 10 late, and the field's log
# has 45, 10 late, in the window. The field's 10 releases and the replay's 10 pair up: 9 within
# 0.44 ms, and one at 3082.62 s that the replay makes one present later (+17 ms). The planner
# line reads 1906 of 1909 synthesized presents planned by the step against 1847 by a guessed
# target; in the field the window's 2033 synthesized presents were all planned or drawn (1936
# warped from a flow handed over earlier, 95 drawn as the blend because the flow was handed over
# at that present, 2 unplanned, none with no flow).
# Bounds on the REPLAY (not the field): inequalities, so an improvement passes and only a
# regression fails. Measured on the policy the capture ran. The worst run is 39 on both arms.
